@startuml UC14_Activity
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

title UC14: Business Activity Diagram - Track Submission Status by Tracking Code

|Submitter|
start
:Navigate to "/check-submission";
:Enter reference tracking code (e.g. KS-2026-TXT001);
:Click "Check Status" button;
|System|
:Query events table by tracking_code;
|Submitter|
if (Tracking code found?) then (Found)
  |System|
  :Display review status badge (PENDING / VERIFIED / REJECTED);
  :Render review timeline and administrator feedback notes;
  stop
else (Not Found)
  |System|
  :Display "Tracking code not found" alert notice;
  stop
endif
@enduml
